  "2026-08-28T20:11:19.721Z",pi-agent,"PR #48 review confirmed this acceptance criterion is intentionally not implemented. The branch contains no publication lock-lease implementation or passing acceptance evidence for this child, so it remains open with its written specification."
  "2026-09-12T23:35:49.681Z",pi-agent,"Audit 2026-09-13: EXISTS — nothing. The description says spec only. grep for lease/Lease/stable-FileId in engine/ returns no matches. No lock lease implementation exists. REMAINS — the full feature: publication refusal for missing, expired, wrong-principal, or out-of-scope lock leases, with four distinct named refusals."
